1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,240
Every factory runs on
machines it cannot fully explain.

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:09,841
When one fails at two
a.m., the question is never

3
00:00:09,841 --> 00:00:12,001
just what broke.
It is why.

4
00:00:12,001 --> 00:00:14,162
And what proof
do you have?

5
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:17,762
Genesis RT is a causal
failure engine for real-time QNX

6
00:00:17,762 --> 00:00:20,283
systems. Watch. Eight
stages. One guided run.

7
00:00:20,283 --> 00:00:22,803
The machine. Its
contract. The generated software.

8
00:00:22,803 --> 00:00:24,603
The failure, reproduced, not described.

9
00:00:24,603 --> 00:00:28,204
Now the diagnosis. Six competing
hypotheses, executed as native experiments.

10
00:00:28,204 --> 00:00:31,805
Five come back inconclusive. One
is supported, with a sealed

11
00:00:31,805 --> 00:00:33,965
evidence dossier behind
it. No guessing.

12
00:00:33,965 --> 00:00:35,765
No green badge on trust.

13
00:00:35,765 --> 00:00:37,926
Every verdict links
to replayable proof.

14
00:00:37,926 --> 00:00:41,166
The binary. The run.
The before and the after.

15
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:43,687
A failed actuator
becomes a decided release.

16
00:00:43,687 --> 00:00:45,847
In seconds, not
sprints. Genesis RT.

17
00:00:45,847 --> 00:00:47,287
From incident to proof.
